pe":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤純奈です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/12/4336194/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校は基本三つ編み"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/12/4336194/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログに\nお誕生日おめでとうコメント\nたくさんありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもとっても\n嬉しかったです( •ᴗ• )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメブロの方には書いたの\nですが、公式ブログの方には\nお誕生日当日の事を書いて\nいなかったので少し書きます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当日には安定の日奈子、未央奈と\n焼肉を食べに行きました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サプライズでケーキを\n2人が用意してくれていて\nびっくり( ･ᴗ･̥̥̥  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼントやお手紙、\n私の写真や日奈子、未央奈との\n写真がたくさん貼ってある色紙も\nプレゼントしてくれて本当に\n嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日はディズニーランドに\n行きました\\( ˆˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せな2日間でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩にも、\nお誕生日プレゼントを頂いて\n幸せ過ぎました( ･ᴗ･̥̥̥  )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます\n大事に使わせて頂